{"path":"/zh/concepts/disk-fact-plane/","title":"磁盘事实平面：用外置合同连接运行阶段","blocks":[{"block_id":"adps-cd41d27476cebba5-1","revision":"cd41d27476cebba599e81ee2d5d3a660f6fb6814574e28553fa1b7188acb47e4","tag":"p","quote":"一份地图数据跑过识别、处理和发布后，进程意外中断。系统要回答已经完成什么、产物在哪里、下一步从哪里继续。只保留内存对象或终端日志，无法给出稳定答案。"},{"block_id":"adps-e9250b6ca5edaa98-1","revision":"e9250b6ca5edaa98df141c19b647a496fa33837f61ce3ef3a31689e2dfe52ad7","tag":"p","quote":"磁盘事实平面使用版本化文件合同保存阶段事实、运行状态和验收证据。进程之间传递路径与引用，不依赖不可恢复的共享内存对象。"},{"block_id":"adps-ec69d09ec5749318-1","revision":"ec69d09ec57493185697a14156bc9699ea36a698cb25d0f8478b33b373be4de8","tag":"p","quote":"玄宿案例包含三类核心文件："},{"block_id":"adps-cb1f85dc47f7975d-1","revision":"cb1f85dc47f7975d4e06c9620a88ccecd1d177cbb00c2be7e5293c9d44781f1d","tag":"li","quote":"metadata.json 保存输入、处理结果和阶段产物引用；"},{"block_id":"adps-d9c6735db28ccdce-1","revision":"d9c6735db28ccdce718c8b2716cf15e97ac414c25929a3ae6b4f595ff3062560","tag":"li","quote":"run-state.json 保存阶段状态、时间、退出码和恢复位置；"},{"block_id":"adps-b9ffdbdd0a81000f-1","revision":"b9ffdbdd0a81000fb8060be85b94f7ca68f6f8307f3888b8ea7fdb52cd252ae9","tag":"li","quote":"verify_report.json 保存外部请求、内容检查和验收结论。"},{"block_id":"adps-1219346dc8635cf2-1","revision":"1219346dc8635cf289b6405fe2bb72903125797110c2946b07ae10a7bc71e9ed","tag":"p","quote":"每类事实有唯一写入者，下游只读，不重新计算。控制台是这些事实的投影视图。"},{"block_id":"adps-229c41ed22bbf1a3-1","revision":"229c41ed22bbf1a31c860b2c9226cfc6d56b1c7bbb34342ce3ffbc09f131145b","tag":"p","quote":"该实现适合单机或受控共享磁盘环境。进入多机、多租户并发写后，事实合同应迁移到具备事务、锁与隔离能力的存储。概念的稳定部分是外置、版本化和可恢复的事实合同，磁盘只是案例中的载体。"},{"block_id":"adps-ebc1cb5aec1e5258-1","revision":"ebc1cb5aec1e52585694353db43c7a7ebf1f5af90a7f3392a6daae02d601376a","tag":"li","quote":"初始案例：玄宿科技 GIS 数据发布 Agent，案例提供熊钰柯（Yuke Xiong）。"},{"block_id":"adps-0d766e2864486226-1","revision":"0d766e2864486226f0357546837844b0d7b58dfce0a7e02176238304f70a01a3","tag":"li","quote":"历史近邻：file-based IPC、single source of truth、append-only state、materialized projection。"},{"block_id":"adps-13a04dfb4dc58243-1","revision":"13a04dfb4dc5824310607f4108dd1b9da4dd7a960ff572b75e983c486ebff361","tag":"li","quote":"ADPS 整理：区分阶段事实、运行状态和验收证据，并加入单写者约束。"},{"block_id":"adps-c04f929401613946-1","revision":"c04f92940161394663ccdc8b2c376af7bf1ee7de19b5252dd73db4a1410709c1","tag":"p","quote":"初始来源：玄宿科技 GIS 数据发布 Agent 案例报告；案例提供：熊钰柯（Yuke Xiong）。"},{"block_id":"adps-07336cb1f093d306-1","revision":"07336cb1f093d306f9f6694518f0138fa9925bd53440f26b6e21d427504c348d","tag":"p","quote":"案例报告目录 · 模式目录 · CC BY 4.0"},{"block_id":"adps-3c551855df185a69-1","revision":"3c551855df185a69bba5e6c436054cab73b1e5df7050f512e066b3f937c0e637","tag":"p","quote":"在 ADPS Chronicle 中查看"}]}
